# Exemptions for lint-language.cjs.
# Words that are ordinary English in context, so they are not enforced from the glossary's Avoid lists:
ignore-term: change
ignore-term: constraint
ignore-term: lock
ignore-term: review
ignore-term: notes
ignore-term: track
ignore-term: phase
ignore-term: customer
ignore-term: edge case
# "approval" names the host's plan-mode approval step:
references/host.md :: approval
references/plan-mode-handoff.md :: approval
# The PRD template mirrors how product documents address their own product's users:
skills/craft-prd/assets/prd-template.md :: user
